        "Description": "Good afternoon, Agent 1114.  After escaping Los Santos with millions to his name by running private shows at the motel, John F. Television has settled down in a nice suburban neighborhood.  The FIB has had enough of his antics, and has hired our services to deal with him.  \r\rStage it as a self inflicted suicide by hunting rifle; no other story will fly under the radar.\r\rGood luck, 1114.",
